---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Testimonials – Fettle, London" description="Nearly everyone on the list came by way of a neighbour. Here is what a few of them say about having Fettle look after their homes.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Testimonials</p>
        <h1>By recommendation, mostly.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Nearly everyone on the list came by way of a neighbour. Here is what a few of them say about having Fettle look after their homes.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reassure">
          <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Same faces each visit</span>
          <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Insured and vetted</span>
          <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Tidy finish</span>
        </div>

        <div class="quote-grid">
          <figure class="quote">
            <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p>They knew where our stopcock was before we did. Three winters in and it is the same two faces every time, which is rather the whole point.</p>
            <figcaption class="who">
              <span class="name">Sarah M.</span>
              <span class="meta">Plimsoll Road &middot; N5</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="quote">
            <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p>A wonky gate, a dripping tap, and a wall that needed making good. One visit, one team, all of it done by lunch and swept up after.</p>
            <figcaption class="who">
              <span class="name">James &amp; Priya K.</span>
              <span class="meta">Bishopswood Road &middot; N6</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="quote">
            <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p>We have a period house that does not forgive shortcuts. Fettle treat it the way you would hope, quietly and properly, and the price was the price we were told.</p>
            <figcaption class="who">
              <span class="name">Eleanor W.</span>
              <span class="meta">Wadham Gardens &middot; NW3</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="quote">
            <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p>What sold me was the once a season look over. They spotted the gutters going before it became a proper job, which is exactly the sort of thing I never get round to.</p>
            <figcaption class="who">
              <span class="name">Tom H.</span>
              <span class="meta">Highbury New Park &middot; N5</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="quote">
            <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p>Dust sheets down, shoes off, radio low. You would hardly know they had been in, apart from the fact everything simply works again.</p>
            <figcaption class="who">
              <span class="name">Priyanka D.</span>
              <span class="meta">Church Crescent &middot; N10</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="quote">
            <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
            <p>We came to them the way most people seem to, a neighbour would not stop going on about them. Now we are the ones going on about them.</p>
            <figcaption class="who">
              <span class="name">Michael R.</span>
              <span class="meta">Fitzjohn&rsquo;s Avenue &middot; NW3</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="prose" style="max-width:none; text-align:center; margin-top:12px">
          <p style="margin:44px 0 20px; color:var(--ink-60)">Room comes up on the list postcode by postcode. If a neighbour sent you, say so.</p>
          <p style="margin:0"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Contact</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
